# Installer Sync Rule

When making product, packaging, or release-related changes:

- Update installer inputs together with app changes (`installer/yt-dlp-gui.iss`, `build_windows.ps1`, `.github/workflows/release.yaml`).
- If launch paths, app name, version flow, or output artifacts change, ensure installer output names/paths still match.
- Keep `README.md` release/build instructions aligned with the actual installer and portable artifacts.
- Verify installer build commands are still runnable (`iscc ...` and `build_windows.ps1` behavior).

Treat installer maintenance as required follow-up work, the same way README maintenance is required.
